 /* The CP's indirect-buffer pointers (a6xx.xml A8XX-: CP_IB1_BASE 0x900, REM 0x902, INIT 0x903, IB2 0x904.., IB3 0x908..), for
  * the BR pipe (out[0..11]) and the BV pipe (out[12..23]): base lo/hi, remaining and initial dwords of IB1, IB2, IB3. */
 bool
